  aciklama:
  - "Sararm\u0131\u015F ve kenarlar\u0131 k\u0131r\u0131\u015F\u0131k bir par\u015F\xF6men
    ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131 belirmi\u015F {{isim}} fincan\u0131nda. Ka\u011F\u0131d\u0131n
    \xFCzerinde ise, {{kelime, sa\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n birka\xE7 tutam\u0131 y\xFCz\xFCne
    d\xFC\u015Fen, kal\u0131n dudakl\u0131, k\u0131s\u0131k g\xF6zlerle bakan | d\xFCz
    sa\xE7l\u0131, sivri \xE7eneli ve iri g\xF6zl\xFC | aln\u0131nda baz\u0131 k\u0131r\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131klar\u0131
    bulunan, ince dudakl\u0131 ve a\xE7\u0131k kumral | geni\u015F a\u011F\u0131zl\u0131,
    sivri burunlu ve aln\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k | ince dudakl\u0131, keskin bak\u0131\u015Fl\u0131
    ve d\xFCzg\xFCn di\u015Flere sahip | ka\u015Flar\u0131 hafif \xE7at\u0131k, elmac\u0131k
    kemikleri \xE7\u0131k\u0131k ve sert miza\xE7l\u0131}} bir {{data, cinsiyet=erkek,
    kad\u0131n\u0131n | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, erke\u011Fin | cinsiyet=lgbt, ki\u015Finin}}
    silueti var. Bu ki\u015Finin {{kelime, i\xE7inde | akl\u0131nda | y\xFCre\u011Finde}},
    vaktiyle fark\u0131nda olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 fakat ya\u015Fayarak \xF6\u011Frendi\u011Fi,
    sana ise aktaramad\u0131\u011F\u0131 \u015Feyler birikmi\u015F {{isim}}. Bu ki\u015Fiyle
    {{sayi,2,8}} hafta i\xE7inde \xE7ok spontan bir yerde kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Facaks\u0131n\u0131z
    ve sonraki g\xFCnlerde sana mesajla baz\u0131 s\xF6yleyecekleri olacak."
